Measurement only. Not for commit: the marks are counters and clock reads for
scripts/measure/analyze_snap.py, with `unsafe` for clock_gettime and getrusage.

Apply to a clean checkout with `git apply scripts/measure/marks.patch`, build with
`RUSTFLAGS="-C force-frame-pointers=yes" cargo build --profile dhat -p phpstan-rs
--bin phpstan-rs`, and run check-project; each mark prints one SNAP line to stderr.
Revert with `git apply -R`.

